      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（冲向前方、冲向未来与胜利。\n燃烧生命产生的这份炽热……\n让心脏越跳越快──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "4210335bf71863937420c9acb07af601a3baaa0524580b1262a206825d05296d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
