    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25086c5f0f2033df633c412b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:529065a7140dc06a71b4a7d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是关于阿尔丹大小姐的身体状况。\n我就开门见山地说了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "63013554bcce12ef1b852634560b6522cd69c8efd15169aea92710500190d9cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a561917342190f8ae948bb8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251aba773823649643a15003",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得大小姐最好暂时停止参赛，\n在这间疗养设施静养一段时间比较好。\n换句话说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9076e5046d472b844c46426fd06aac27169be802ddf02012f08a9c9c85c5dd29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:435d2cb4ca6a62d5f6ede182",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cd530f0b90fd59a956804c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34fbad91156b8a00bc15f8ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "希望你能再次考虑现在是否\n有必要急着挑战闪耀系列赛。\n以上就是我的见解。",
      "source_fingerprint": "926610e25a151754b703dfb6f550719dc25552985518802fc62ec77243bfb04d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59388bed044199bc672148e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9561a81192de106240b9adc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──大小姐这次之所以会倒下，\n应该是之前积累了太多负担身心俱疲，\n然后在比赛结束后一口气爆发导致的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a491a6063d36c8880046c96f4f8ff5f7d449286c2e0fff80fdbd73db310193",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a64566a685d1885ae9d8488",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
