    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33fb78b53c3e2e05c7afb16",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练造成的身体疲惫。\n以及比赛临近而产生的紧张情绪，\n或是周遭沉重的压力──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b450dd7e1c59710e3ae78453a3164a9f3beaaeb0eb4df80d30438b00dbc0ed4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        35,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/35/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:778fc886de8544f988ca5baf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b941dadf9b4a704dacb443",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "除此之外，还有认真对决时产生的精力消耗，\n这部分完全不是训练能够比拟的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba6ae6b162f2533e36770633a463b97ce9f4b173d7ea3804af97e5eef1afeed8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        36,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/36/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de7b034f816d0a603d6a00d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主治医生",
      "source_fingerprint": "24cc43b27409017ca78b242c0620db0aa2988dbf86965ad16da1cad872dd2404",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1071/storytimeline_501071303.json",
      "json_path": [
