      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我明白大小姐对比赛\n有多么执着。\n所以绝对不是想泼她冷水。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2913adb458a3c1d1c591df77a7241097f277c06b68d8d9adf634f427c571f2",
