    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99b15d1213fb38d421ea80c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然最终的决定权还是握在大小姐手上。\n不过，希望训练员也能将这件事\n放在心里──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffba434d6aef0f514fd4ee8eb541e94816a89d3af2144178ec69293e3b9c4470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
